      "id": "claim_b7bd4d11653648ff9b65476e4a806c9f",
      "statement": "detectPlateau in src/lib/strength/plateau.ts only flags a plateau when stalledExposures >= patience AND stalledSinceDays >= MIN_PLATEAU_DAYS (14), where stalledSinceDays is measured as elapsed training time between the last new-best exposure and the most recent exposure, not wall-clock time since now.",
